      "role": "user",
      "content": "breathing doesnt do anything. it just makes me more aware of how much everything hurts. there's no amount of deep breaths that can fix the fact that everything is just... exhausting. i feel like i've been running on empty for years. i just want to find some way to finally get some actual, permanent peace.",
